1
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:15,044
Tu es libre samedi ?
Are you free on Saturday?

2
00:00:15,144 --> 00:00:17,900
Oui, pourquoi ?
Yes, why?

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,756
On va au cinéma ?
Shall we go to the cinema?

4
00:00:20,856 --> 00:00:25,004
Bonne idée ! À quelle heure ?
Good idea! At what time?

5
00:00:25,104 --> 00:00:27,596
À sept heures.
At seven.

6
00:00:27,696 --> 00:00:32,084
D'accord. On se retrouve où ?
OK. Where shall we meet?

7
00:00:32,184 --> 00:00:34,916
Devant le cinéma.
In front of the cinema.

8
00:00:35,016 --> 00:00:39,452
Parfait. Je vais acheter les billets.
Perfect. I'll buy the tickets.

9
00:00:39,552 --> 00:00:43,796
Super ! À samedi !
Great! See you Saturday!
